1
00:00:00,242 --> 00:00:02,452
Well, all right, then.

2
00:00:06,122 --> 00:00:08,872
(Penny:)Sheldon? What are you doing?

3
00:00:09,042 --> 00:00:14,502
Playing "Super Mario"
on a poorly coded Nintendo 64 emulator.

4
00:00:14,965 --> 00:00:16,795
(Penny:)But why are you doing it on the stairs?

5
00:00:16,967 --> 00:00:20,637
I am a modern-day Napoleon
exiled to the Elba of the staircase...

6
00:00:20,804 --> 00:00:23,894
(Sheldon:)...because Leonard, get this, has a date.

7
00:00:24,224 --> 00:00:27,894
(Penny:)Oh. Oh, well, good for him.

8
00:00:28,061 --> 00:00:31,771
Yeah, but why are you sitting here?
Why don't you go to a movie or something?

9
00:00:31,940 --> 00:00:33,650
(Sheldon:)Alone?

10
00:00:33,817 --> 00:00:36,237
- Yeah, why not?
- What if I choke on my popcorn?

11
00:00:36,403 --> 00:00:38,733
(Sheldon:)Who will administer
the Heimlich maneuver?

12
00:00:39,447 --> 00:00:41,827
(Penny:)- Then don't order popcorn.
- No popcorn at the mov...?

13
00:00:41,992 --> 00:00:43,072
(Sheldon:)Listen to yourself.

14
00:00:44,744 --> 00:00:47,414
- Why don't you go to a coffee shop?
- I don't drink coffee.

15
00:00:47,581 --> 00:00:49,661
(Penny:)They have other things.

16
00:00:49,833 --> 00:00:53,123
- What do they have?
- I don't know. You know, cookies, pastries...

17
00:00:53,295 --> 00:00:56,335
- Pastries such as bear claws?
- Yeah, sure.

18
00:00:56,506 --> 00:00:59,026
I don't like bear claws.

